    "status": "complete",
    "summary": "Session retrieval is modeled as a pure projection over authoritative authentication state. Session capability, required/recommended/allowed logical actions, entry intent, presentation context, and platform navigation are separate concerns. Destructive entry-intent consumption is now an explicit action, transition, and scenario rather than a hidden side effect of reading the session. Next major area: Section 4.14, Account recovery."
